<title>USA: Respironics sees Q3 in line with estimates.</title>
<headline>Respironics sees Q3 in line with estimates.</headline>
<dateline>MURRYSVILLE, Pa. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Respironics Inc said it expects its first quarter results to be in line with analysts' expectations and that its business continues to remain strong.</p>
<p>Wall Street analysts expect Respironics to earn about $0.22 a share for the first quarter ended September 30, 1996, according to First Call.</p>
<p>In last year's first quarter, the company reported earnings of $0.18 a share.</p>
<p>Respironics said it expects to announce those results in late October.</p>
</text>
